### Call Bot AI — requêtes de test (extension VSCode "REST Client" / humao.rest-client)
### Lance d'abord l'app : docker compose up -d --build
### Clique sur "Send Request" au-dessus de chaque bloc.
### Lance "register" puis "login" en premier : leurs réponses sont réutilisées ensuite.
### Les ids sont chaînés automatiquement (createRestaurant -> createTable -> ...),
### donc envoie les requêtes "create" dans l'ordre avant de tester list/get/update/delete.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Ping (public, pas de token)
GET {{host}}/api/ping

### Inscription — crée un utilisateur + une organisation, renvoie un JWT
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Connexion — renvoie un JWT (réutilisé via {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}})
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Utilisateur courant (protégé)
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### ───────────────────────── ORGANISATION ─────────────────────────
### ⚠️ Pas encore d'endpoint pour lister les organisations.
### Récupère l'UUID dans DBeaver :  SELECT id FROM organizations;
### puis colle-le ici :
@organizationId = add4c389-6f15-440f-be58-a168179c7a82


### ───────────────────────── RESTAURANTS ─────────────────────────

### Créer un restaurant
# @name createRestaurant
POST {{host}}/api/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "name": "Chez Test 2",
  "phoneNumber": "+33100000011",
  "city": "Paris"
}

### Lister tous les restaurants
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lister les restaurants d'une organisation
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants?organizationId={{organizationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Récupérer un restaurant par id
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants/{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Modifier un restaurant
PUT {{host}}/api/restaurants/{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "name": "Chez Test (modifié)",
  "phoneNumber": "+33100000001",
  "city": "Lyon"
}

### Supprimer un restaurant
DELETE {{host}}/api/restaurants/{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### ───────────────────────── TABLES ─────────────────────────

### Créer une table
# @name createTable
POST {{host}}/api/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "name": "T1",
  "capacity": 4
}

### Lister toutes les tables
GET {{host}}/api/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lister les tables d'un restaurant
GET {{host}}/api/tables?restaurantId={{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Récupérer une table par id
GET {{host}}/api/tables/{{createTable.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Modifier une table
PUT {{host}}/api/tables/{{createTable.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "name": "T1",
  "capacity": 6,
  "zone": "terrasse"
}

### Supprimer une table
DELETE {{host}}/api/tables/{{createTable.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### ───────────────────────── HORAIRES ─────────────────────────

### Définir des horaires
# @name createHours
POST {{host}}/api/restaurant-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "dayOfWeek": 5,
  "service": "dinner",
  "opensAt": "19:00",
  "closesAt": "23:00"
}

### Lister tous les horaires
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lister les horaires d'un restaurant
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant-hours?restaurantId={{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Récupérer un horaire par id
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant-hours/{{createHours.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Modifier un horaire
PUT {{host}}/api/restaurant-hours/{{createHours.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "dayOfWeek": 5,
  "service": "dinner",
  "opensAt": "18:30",
  "closesAt": "23:30"
}

### Supprimer un horaire
DELETE {{host}}/api/restaurant-hours/{{createHours.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### ───────────────────────── CLIENTS ─────────────────────────

### Créer un client
# @name createCustomer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "phone": "+33600000000",
  "firstName": "Alice"
}

### Lister tous les clients
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lister les clients d'un restaurant
GET {{host}}/api/customers?restaurantId={{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Récupérer un client par id
GET {{host}}/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Modifier un client
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "phone": "+33600000000",
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "email": "alice@example.com"
}

### Supprimer un client
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### ───────────────────────── RÉSERVATIONS ─────────────────────────

### Créer une réservation
# @name createReservation
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "tableId": "{{createTable.response.body.$.id}}",
  "customerId": "{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-01T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2030-01-01T21:00:00Z",
  "partySize": 2
}

### Réservation qui chevauche la même table → doit renvoyer 409 (contrainte EXCLUDE)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "tableId": "{{createTable.response.body.$.id}}",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-01T20:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2030-01-01T22:00:00Z",
  "partySize": 2
}

### Lister toutes les réservations
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lister les réservations d'un restaurant
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?restaurantId={{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Récupérer une réservation par id
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Récupérer une réservation AVEC les objets liés (table + client imbriqués)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}?expand=table,customer
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lister les réservations d'un restaurant, table imbriquée uniquement
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?restaurantId={{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}&expand=table
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Modifier une réservation
PUT {{host}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "tableId": "{{createTable.response.body.$.id}}",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-01T19:30:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2030-01-01T21:30:00Z",
  "partySize": 4
}

### Supprimer une réservation
DELETE {{host}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
